{"id":"CL-2b1131218a83","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"Outsourcing of IT Services Directions - Demo Excerpt","heading_path":[],"level":0,"parent_id":null,"text":"Outsourcing of IT Services Directions - Demo Excerpt\nSYNTHETIC DEMO EXCERPT: paraphrased for a hackathon demonstration. Not the official text; clause numbering is illustrative. Verify against the official publication.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":0,"char_end":217,"content_hash":"8e86c83f6c33743962893742508cc78ef2b79491f28345b1d01bdf975cef7a99"}
{"id":"CL-00128c13571b","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"Chapter I","heading_path":[],"level":0,"parent_id":null,"text":"CHAPTER I Governance","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":218,"char_end":238,"content_hash":"fbbe80a80237a56c709b897cffc33d0d7b93d7d3ba57b8add81aa25270088239"}
{"id":"CL-e845ea0e7fca","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"1","heading_path":["CHAPTER I Governance"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-00128c13571b","text":"1. Every RE shall put in place a Board approved policy on IT outsourcing.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":239,"char_end":312,"content_hash":"8b5f80859275f742c12af690c32129022149a0ea11fe2a018983fbb2962f0207"}
{"id":"CL-afdc7dd0f564","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"2","heading_path":["CHAPTER I Governance"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-00128c13571b","text":"2. The IT Strategy Committee of the RE shall exercise oversight of all IT outsourcing arrangements.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":313,"char_end":412,"content_hash":"1e63391e7707f8d4720ee6663583e997db463b5131b06dde522126346c2fccc8"}
{"id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"Chapter II","heading_path":[],"level":0,"parent_id":null,"text":"CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":413,"char_end":455,"content_hash":"8df503cd3bcf94cf12e1567ee1f5f8f2ca04d36a8bd3d96ff7bfb59bf88491ff"}
{"id":"CL-c8c2785cee1b","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"3","heading_path":["CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","text":"3. The RE shall assess the materiality of each outsourcing arrangement before entering into it.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":456,"char_end":551,"content_hash":"62b23c683fbc19fedfc11959d8a32ebbd08933255bc47ba05a7f2742474cd3dd"}
{"id":"CL-6f568abea332","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"4","heading_path":["CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","text":"4. The RE shall maintain an inventory of all outsourced IT services.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":552,"char_end":620,"content_hash":"715f9e97607049791e8f6d261713e851445270497f72e90dea623011a71baea2"}
{"id":"CL-90ca9f2d6553","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"5","heading_path":["CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","text":"5. The RE shall carry out due diligence of the service provider before outsourcing.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":621,"char_end":704,"content_hash":"6b64e4431a130ee99a5f35a757fa8a288aebab839e1956a155eb8c8fc1b44678"}
{"id":"CL-27eeee3ecbd0","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"6","heading_path":["CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","text":"6. The RE shall ensure that the agreement provides access and audit rights to the regulated entity and to the RBI.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":705,"char_end":819,"content_hash":"b55d3ce02b6d96ae3cefe5054747927ad9b8a89039c41d10891db21b141bcdb7"}
{"id":"CL-119200328dff","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"7","heading_path":["CHAPTER II Engagement of Service Providers"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-7c2b42d6c5f6","text":"7. The RE shall ensure that the agreement covers confidentiality, sub-contracting and termination.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":820,"char_end":918,"content_hash":"ff990fcc5ff88a9fed7549fab95547d1f8cdc039f5304532d071e78ca39c4680"}
{"id":"CL-c3e737eb75cb","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"Chapter III","heading_path":[],"level":0,"parent_id":null,"text":"CHAPTER III Monitoring","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":919,"char_end":941,"content_hash":"dc85fa483f5772da0df50156e64a2ebf5ce39bb664926fa6553617640708fa10"}
{"id":"CL-6373fdec65f0","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"8","heading_path":["CHAPTER III Monitoring"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-c3e737eb75cb","text":"8. The RE shall undertake periodic risk assessment and performance monitoring of service providers.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":942,"char_end":1041,"content_hash":"5858e1088b0251650a4f77ff29903a8dc7449ebd11ecadbf1198c10bbd05e29e"}
{"id":"CL-ac54db93e378","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"9","heading_path":["CHAPTER III Monitoring"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-c3e737eb75cb","text":"9. The RE shall put in place controls over service provider access to regulated entity systems and data.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":1042,"char_end":1146,"content_hash":"2855096b5d1693fc40b2e4d7e32ba609051c909eef828d3015bcccd191176dd8"}
{"id":"CL-4135a52e58df","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"10","heading_path":["CHAPTER III Monitoring"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-c3e737eb75cb","text":"10. The RE shall monitor the concentration risk of service providers.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":1147,"char_end":1216,"content_hash":"17bb47e16ef14a90738d2bbca774fb997ef6b13d54623e5830da191fbfcf58fb"}
{"id":"CL-cd06bfad16cc","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"Chapter IV","heading_path":[],"level":0,"parent_id":null,"text":"CHAPTER IV Business Continuity and Exit","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":1217,"char_end":1256,"content_hash":"13d736819697fd5e3bae6094f4e18ac73fa08dae7815b527b3a7181b1ca55c81"}
{"id":"CL-3c538dadb58c","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"11","heading_path":["CHAPTER IV Business Continuity and Exit"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-cd06bfad16cc","text":"11. The RE shall ensure that a business continuity and disaster recovery plan with the service provider is in place and periodically tested.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":1257,"char_end":1397,"content_hash":"57cf3a2beb2d7936149676e84e58ae87e4182734f41b95662bb54aa2fc0c2d16"}
{"id":"CL-49943c38967c","doc_id":"RBI-ITO-2023","version_id":"VER-e77f7a6d5939","doc_type":"REGULATION","clause_ref":"12","heading_path":["CHAPTER IV Business Continuity and Exit"],"level":1,"parent_id":"CL-cd06bfad16cc","text":"12. The RE shall have an exit strategy for outsourcing arrangements.","page_start":null,"page_end":null,"char_start":1398,"char_end":1466,"content_hash":"4eaa50bb87a4e0f8c86c28d5ca730d848cd03860f2882af391cf0cf04700abb9"}
